Nested dictionary ekak `sep` walin join wechcha keys thiyena single-level dictionary ekakata flatten karana Python function ekak `flatten_nested_dict(d: dict, sep: str = ".") -> dict` liyanna.
Empty sub-dictionaries thiyenawa nam ewa `{}` widiyatama adala key eka yatathe thiyenna ona.
Empty input dictionary ekakata `{}` return karanna.

Example:
    d = {"user": {"name": "Alice", "address": {"city": "Colombo"}}, "active": True}
    flatten_nested_dict(d) -> {"user.name": "Alice", "user.address.city": "Colombo", "active": True}
